### 🚀 Tech Challenge Backend - API Requests
### Documentação interativa: http://localhost:8080/docs/index.html

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### 🔐 Authentication - Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

### 🔗 Set Authorization Token (copie o token do response acima)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 👥 Customers - Listar todos os clientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 👥 Customers - Criar novo cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "João Silva",
  "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
  "phone": "(11) 99999-9999",
  "document": "123.456.789-00",
  "address": {
    "street": "Rua das Flores, 123",
    "city": "São Paulo",
    "state": "SP",
    "zipCode": "01234-567"
  }
}

### 🚗 Vehicles - Listar todos os veículos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/veiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 🚗 Vehicles - Criar novo veículo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/veiculos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "costumer_id": "{{customer_id}}",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Corolla",
  "year": 2020,
  "license_plate": "ABC-1234",
  "color": "Prata",
  "engine": "1.8 Flex"
}

### 📦 Consumables - Listar consumíveis
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consumables
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 📦 Consumables - Criar consumível
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consumables
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Óleo Motor 5W30",
  "description": "Óleo mineral para motores flex",
  "unit": "L",
  "unit_price": 25.90,
  "category": "Lubrificantes"
}

### 🔧 Service Definitions - Listar serviços
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/service-definitions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 🔧 Service Definitions - Criar definição de serviço
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/service-definitions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Troca de Óleo",
  "description": "Troca completa do óleo do motor",
  "estimated_duration_minutes": 30,
  "price": 80.00,
  "category": "Manutenção Preventiva"
}

### 📋 Work Orders - Listar ordens de serviço
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/work-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 📋 Work Orders - Criar ordem de serviço
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/work-orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "costumer_id": "{{customer_id}}",
  "vehicle_id": "{{vehicle_id}}",
  "description": "Manutenção preventiva completa",
  "services": [
    {
      "service_definition_id": "{{service_id}}",
      "quantity": 1,
      "notes": "Usar óleo 5W30"
    }
  ],
  "consumables": [
    {
      "consumable_id": "{{consumable_id}}",
      "quantity": 4,
      "unit_price": 25.90
    }
  ]
}

### 📋 Work Orders - Consultar ordem específica
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/work-orders/{{work_order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 📊 Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 📚 API Documentation (Swagger)
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs/swagger.json

### 🔍 Observability - Metrics
# Verificar se métricas estão sendo coletadas (se habilitado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 🧪 Environment Variables for Testing
# Local Development
# baseUrl: http://localhost:8080

# Docker Environment
# baseUrl: http://localhost:8080

# Staging/Production
# baseUrl: https://your-staging-api.com
